"version": "1",
"text": "Your outfit combines a blue-and-chocolate striped knit polo with relaxed sleeves and fine eyelet holes, worn underneath a high-necked puffer vest in a muted milk-chocolate tone. The base is set by straight-cut trousers in a dark graphite shade, finished with classic black loafers that carry a polished finish and subtle hardware accents. A soft camel suede tote hangs at your side to balance the structured lines above while introducing warmth and fluidity.",
"how_to_wear": "Wear the polo underneath the vest to let its collar frame the neckline without adding bulk. Keep the trousers untucked and fully zipped for a clean silhouette from hip to hem. Wear the loafers with socks only in cooler days, letting them sit directly on your shoes otherwise. Carry the tote by its long strap so it rests at your hip while walking.",
