"n": "#48·31",
"text": "This is a blue-and-chocolate striped knit polo with three-quarter sleeves and an eyelet pattern across the body. The collar stands crisp while the fabric feels soft and breathable for layering or wearing alone."
},
{
"n": "#118·12",
"text": "A tall-necked puffer vest in a milk-chocolate brown, quilted in wide horizontal panels with a full-length zipper and stand collar. It adds warmth without adding volume to the shoulders or torso."
},
{
"n": "#284·31",
"text": "Straight-leg trousers in graphite grey woven from a wool blend for structure and drape. The cut flows cleanly from hip to ankle, offering a quiet anchor for the layered tops above."
},
{
"n": "#191·11",
"text": "Black leather loafers with a modest stacked heel and polished surface. A thin strap across the vamp holds a small metallic detail that catches light without overpowering the neutral palette."
},
{
"n": "#88·22",
"text": "A camel suede tote bag shaped in soft slouchy lines, equipped with long handles and a drawstring pouch attached to the front for small essentials. Its texture contrasts gently with the knits and leather in the outfit."
}
]
